    "regime_notes": "20d and 40d horizons passed full-sample gates. 2023-2028 IC 0.1744 (130 dates); 2029-2035 IC 0.0313 (615 dates), indicating positive but regime-dependent persistence. Small 15-asset universe warrants conservative interpretation.",
